        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(admin-http-rpc): reject oversized declared request bodies",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where Admin HTTP RPC callers could send oversized JSON request bodies and lose the structured 413 response when the request exceeded the 1 MiB route limit.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThe Admin HTTP RPC handler now rejects oversized declared `Content-Length` values before reading the body and keeps streamed/chunked overflow on a response-safe route-local reader. This preserves the structured 413 response for both transfer modes without changing the RPC allowlist, Gateway authentication, or method dispatch behavior.\n\n## User Impact\n\nOperators and host tooling using `POST /api/v1/admin/rpc` get a clear HTTP 413 JSON response for oversized declared or streamed request bodies, and invalid oversized requests do not reach Gateway RPC dispatch.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Claim proved: at current head `41b8a302b1c9099a48c6f86cc814a9f9bf66be4c`, Admin HTTP RPC delivers structured HTTP 413 JSON to real Node HTTP clients for declared oversized and streamed/chunked oversized bodies, and `dispatchGatewayMethod` is not called.\n- Focused regression: `node scripts\\run-vitest.mjs extensions/admin-http-rpc/src/handler.test.ts --reporter=verbose` passed with 1 file and 14 tests, including real HTTP client coverage for both declared and streamed oversized bodies.\n- Sibling guard regression: `node scripts\\run-vitest.mjs src/infra/http-body.test.ts --reporter=verbose` passed with 1 file and 13 tests.\n- Targeted lint: `node_modules\\.bin\\oxlint.CMD extensions\\admin-http-rpc\\src\\handler.ts extensions\\admin-http-rpc\\src\\handler.test.ts` passed.\n- Targeted format: `node_modules\\.bin\\oxfmt.CMD --check --threads=1 extensions\\admin-http-rpc\\src\\handler.ts extensions\\admin-http-rpc\\src\\handler.test.ts` passed.\n- Diff hygiene: `git diff --check upstream/main...HEAD` passed; the PR diff against current `upstream/main` remains limited to `extensions/admin-http-rpc/src/handler.ts` and `extensions/admin-http-rpc/src/handler.test.ts`.\n- Real behavior proof: GitHub `Real behavior proof` passed on current head `41b8a302b1c9099a48c6f86cc814a9f9bf66be4c`: https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/29246093361/job/86803242257\n\nAI-assisted: yes. I reviewed the Admin HTTP RPC route boundary, streamed body overflow path, focused tests, and ClawSweeper feedback before updating this PR.",
